{"duration": 63.67, "segments": [{"scene": "hook", "text": "Don Tino cría cerdos en el patio. Y ahora, toda la cuadra huele a chiquero.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 0.4, "end": 4.84, "words": [{"w": "Dontino", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.9}, {"w": "cría", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.22}, {"w": "cerdos", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.62}, {"w": "en", "s": 1.62, "e": 1.76}, {"w": "el", "s": 1.76, "e": 1.88}, {"w": "patio", "s": 1.88, "e": 2.16}, {"w": "y", "s": 2.16, "e": 2.72}, {"w": "ahora", "s": 2.72, "e": 3.0}, {"w": "toda", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.3}, {"w": "la", "s": 3.3, "e": 3.5}, {"w": "cuadra", "s": 3.5, "e": 3.86}, {"w": "huele", "s": 3.86, "e": 4.16}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.16, "e": 4.26}, {"w": "chiquero.", "s": 4.26, "e": 4.6}]}, {"scene": "problemas", "text": "Moscas por todos lados, mal olor, y el agua sucia del corral baja directo a la calle.", "pause": 0.25, "start": 5.04, "end": 10.07, "words": [{"w": "Moscas", "s": 5.04, "e": 5.48}, {"w": "por", "s": 5.48, "e": 5.66}, {"w": "todos", "s": 5.66, "e": 5.88}, {"w": "lados,", "s": 5.88, "e": 6.26}, {"w": "mal", "s": 6.6, "e": 6.76}, {"w": "olor", "s": 6.76, "e": 7.16}, {"w": "y", "s": 7.16, "e": 7.48}, {"w": "el", "s": 7.48, "e": 7.6}, {"w": "agua", "s": 7.6, "e": 7.76}, {"w": "sucia", "s": 7.76, "e": 8.18}, {"w": "del", "s": 8.18, "e": 8.3}, {"w": "corral", "s": 8.3, "e": 8.64}, {"w": "baja", "s": 8.64, "e": 8.94}, {"w": "directo", "s": 8.94, "e": 9.48}, {"w": "a", "s": 9.48, "e": 9.52}, {"w": "la", "s": 9.52, "e": 9.6}, {"w": "calle.", "s": 9.6, "e": 9.92}]}, {"scene": "pleito", "who": "chabela", "voice": "ef_dora", "text": "¡Ya no aguantamos ese olor! Ni las ventanas podemos abrir, y mis hijos viven enfermos.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 10.32, "end": 15.4, "words": [{"w": "Ya", "s": 10.32, "e": 10.5}, {"w": "no", "s": 10.5, "e": 10.64}, {"w": "aguantamos", "s": 10.64, "e": 11.16}, {"w": "ese", "s": 11.16, "e": 11.44}, {"w": "olor,", "s": 11.44, "e": 11.94}, {"w": "ni", "s": 12.1, "e": 12.24}, {"w": "las", "s": 12.24, "e": 12.38}, {"w": "ventanas", "s":